WEBVTT

00:16:29.500 --> 00:16:33.476
isn't born into a society riddled
with homophobia and transphobia

00:16:33.500 --> 00:16:36.268
and anti-Semitism
and Islamophobia and ableism,

00:16:36.292 --> 00:16:37.809
and all the phobias and -isms?

00:16:37.833 --> 00:16:40.559
What are we prepared to do today,

00:16:40.583 --> 00:16:42.393
so that 50 years from now

00:16:42.417 --> 00:16:45.226
we have a road in our society
that's structured

00:16:45.250 --> 00:16:48.851
to reflect what we hold
to be self-evident?

00:16:48.875 --> 00:16:51.809
That all men, that all women,

00:16:51.833 --> 00:16:53.934
that even all trans people

00:16:53.958 --> 00:16:55.476
are created equal

00:16:55.500 --> 00:16:59.268
and are endowed by your Creator
with certain unalienable rights,

00:16:59.292 --> 00:17:03.684
including life, liberty
and the pursuit of happiness.